# playpick cell: mode=menus view=820x1180,touch save=carried
#
# README's Sharing section: "A day link opens today's run rather than the
# day it names -- a daily ends at midnight and so does the comparison it was
# shared for." Never tested live. Today's real daily (read via a separate
# probe invocation, no hash) is The Three Crowns, 25-player heroic, HASTENED.
# This opens with #d= pointing at a day years in the past and checks whether
# the daily screen still shows that same fight rather than an old one.
open #d=20200101
tap daily
targets
state
shot dated-link
